      "text": "Grouped bar chart “RA. 4.2 – Budget execution, by line, Lupara District (%)” for 2015–2019, with bars for personnel, services, administration, investments and total budget. Execution is about 85–100% for all lines in 2015–2017; in 2018–2019 administration drops to about 55% and investments to about 20% and then about 5%, while in 2019 personnel (about 113%) and services (about 121%) exceed 100%.",
